<title>USA: Provident Bancorp sets three-for-two split.</title>
<headline>Provident Bancorp sets three-for-two split.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provident Bancorp Inc said it has declared a three-for-two stock split to shareholders payable December 19, record December 12.</p>
<p>In addition, Provident said its board approved an increase in the annual dividend rate on its common shares to $.96 per share from $.84 per share on a pre-split basis.  The increased dividend will be paid beginning with Provident's February, 1997 regular quarterly dividend.</p>
</text>
